  "description": "COMFORTABLE, LIGHTWEIGHT, AND HIGHLY RESPONSIVE\n\nBuilt like all BH high-end frames, using Hollow Core Internal Molding (HCIM) Carbon Molding technology that allows us to minimize frame weight.\n\nMOTOR BHZ BY SEG AUTOMOTIVE\n\nExperience the power of the BHZ motor by SEG, which at only 2.1 kg transforms your pedaling into speed and energy. With a maximum torque of 65 Nm and a nominal power of 250 W, reaching up to 500 W, this motor is designed to deliver exceptional performance.\n\nADDITIONAL XPRO BATTERY, PLUG & RIDE\n\nAll models come equipped with a 420Wh battery located in the down tubE. This battery, composed of 21700 cells with 5.8Ah, offers maximum energy density and allows more energy to be stored in a compact space, resulting in a low center of gravity for natural handling. Additionally, the external XPro battery provides an extra 180Wh, increasing the range to 180km.\n\niGravelX HEART\n\nAdjust the assistance level using an LED system.\n\nCHARGING PORT\n\nThe charging port of the iGravelX is integrated and protected in the lower part of the seat tube.\n\nAIRBOW GRAVEL FORK\n\nIncorporates the Air Bow fork, with its distinctive and maximized shape to allow wheel clearance for tires up to 45mm.\n\niBUTTONS\n\nTwo coin-sized wireless Bluetooth buttons that can be mounted anywhere on the handlebar with elastic bands, even under bar tape. Battery- powered wireless operation connects seamlessly via Bluetooth to your bike's system for instant control access.",
